<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Anchoring Refusal Direction: Mitigating Safety Risks in Tuning via Projection Constraint</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yanrui Du
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Fenglei Fan
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Sendong Zhao
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Jiawei Cao
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Qika Lin
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Kai He
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Ting Liu
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Bing Qin
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Mengling Feng
</span><span id="id1" class="ltx_note ltx_note_frontmatter ltx_thanks_correspondence ltx_role_thanks"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_type">thanks: </span>
Yanrui Du, Sendong Zhao, Jiawwei Cao, Ting Liu, and Bing Qin are with SCIR Lab, Harbin Institute of Technology, China. Email: {yrdu,sdzhao,jwcao,tliu,qinb}@ir.hit.edu.cn.
Fenglei Fan is with the City University of Hong Kong, Hong Kong. Email: fenglfan@cityu.edu.hk.
